  "patthana14.6:0.3": "6. Nahetusahetukadukaṃ 1-7. Paṭiccavārādi ",
  "patthana14.6:1.1": "Nahetuṃ sahetukaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca nahetu nasahetuko dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. (Saṃkhittaṃ.) ",
  "patthana14.6:2.1": "Hetuyā nava. (Sahajātavārampi…pe… pañhāvārampi vitthāretabbaṃ.) ",
  "patthana14.6:3.1": "Hetugocchakaṃ niṭṭhitaṃ. "
}
